   478	## 6. Branch-A control
   479	
   480	The self-contained control rebuilds the charged predecessor in
   481	
   482	```text
   483	Q[h_0_8,...,h_0_0,bp,bq,br,bs,c,T]
   484	```
   485	
   486	with 14 unknowns excluding `T`:
   487	
